    "agentMessage": "Renew at office instead of online - from page **\"Renew in Person at an Office\"**:\n\n**Short answer:** You can renew at a local office instead of online. To save time bring your notice and documents and complete any available pre-application worksheet in advance.\n\n**How it works:**\n1. Choose an office location and time that works for you.\n2. Bring your renewal notice, current license, and any documents listed for your renewal type.\n3. Check in on arrival and follow staff directions for photo and review.\n\n**Tip for shorter visit:** double-check your papers the night before and arrive a little early for your time slot.\n\n**Save time by scheduling - from \"Appointments / How to schedule\":**\n- Short answer: Appointments are scheduled through the official appointment system. Choose service type, location, and time, then save your confirmation.\n1. Select \"driver's license renewal\" as service reason.\n2. Enter your ZIP or county to see nearby offices.\n3. Pick a date and time and save confirmation details.\n- If no times are available, try another nearby office or check back later. You can reschedule or cancel with confirmation information."
